{
  "revision": 20261115,
  "character": "蕾叶的奶奶",
  "voices": [
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_030",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "そう、いい宿だよ〜。まだ寝てるヤツもいるし、 ギリギリまで温泉を楽しんでるヤツもいるし",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_030.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "ff045086828df3a18a4ced0f15d86ab90b3d1ee7166bf3c6b8239119966d777a",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_030.wav",
      "subtitle": "是啊，那家旅馆很不错～还有人还在睡懒觉，\n也有人抓紧最后一刻还在泡温泉",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_061",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "昔から泣く時は必ず１人になる。 カーテンの裏に隠れて、ちっこい背中を丸めて",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_061.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "f27baf6f931c055689abb322779aedffc99c657f54115e61ff70cc5191ed02c2",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_061.wav",
      "subtitle": "你从小一哭就肯定是自己一个人躲起来。\n躲在窗帘后面，蜷着小小的背",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_063",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "あれだけいいファミリーに出会えたんだ。 その寂しさを、ちゃんと分けっこできる人がいる",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_063.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "55b54f5140994c115006833c2156b2aed9407a2275afcbc8d03a8100cada26e9",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_063.wav",
      "subtitle": "你能遇到这么棒的Family。\n有了可以和你一起分担这份难过的人",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_028",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『実は、鈴木が直接電話をよこしてきたんだよ。 ライブハウスの取引がしたいってさ』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_028.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "752bef11ea66f1c23a0acd651175ab2488d6a849e4f95336ae7ae01a272ac55f",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_028.wav",
      "subtitle": "『其实，铃木直接给我打了电话。\n说想谈关于Live House的生意』",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_031",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『蕾叶からそう聞いてたから、その話は私からも断った。 蕾叶が決めたことを続けさせるのが親の務めだからな』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_031.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "51649b5b741cad89c9243499dc0a5eb3318af0d2d8d8bd4beb07f07f6f74a0a5",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_031.wav",
      "subtitle": "『我从蕾叶那儿听说了，所以我也拒绝了这件事。\n让蕾叶坚持自己决定的事，是家长的责任啊』",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_045",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『今日は絶対テントで寝る！ って言うから 慌ててペグなしのテントを買ったんだからな？』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_045.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "afc86c5598dd59d44621f7e57f71505beaedc7b3ace974c779f9caec8a419fcf",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_045.wav",
      "subtitle": "『今日は絶対テントで寝る！ って言うから 慌ててペグなしのテントを買ったんだからな？』",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_059",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『ファミリーの先輩として……蕾叶の親として、 私は蕾叶が決めたことを全力で応援するよ』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_059.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "3ba1585c81240063277ec0b5a47d2d15c42a02f9b7e82f7b30875e9483e78903",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_059.wav",
      "subtitle": "『ファミリーの先輩として……蕾叶の親として、 私は蕾叶が決めたことを全力で応援するよ』",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_027",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10099",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "ファミリーを取り戻すためでも 人様のライブをブチ壊すなんてダメに決まってるだろ！！",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_027.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "9dc541377efc7582e5fb1b8e35162f214d71d446e4b1a74ced6aaa56f58c12cc",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_027.wav",
      "subtitle": "就算是为了夺回Family，\n你也不能去把别人家的演出搅得一团糟啊！！",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_036",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10099",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "おや、そっちにいるのが、蕾叶のファミリーだね。 蕾叶と仲良くしてくれてありがとうね〜",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_036.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "161ef23771f65d028c2930728ddabcfcb6f923ec7d74ea069ae7a9861b79c802",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_036.wav",
      "subtitle": "哎呀，你们几位就是蕾叶的Family吧。\n平时多谢你们照顾我们家蕾叶啦～",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_050",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10099",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "……まあ、鈴木さんも子ども相手に随分なことを してくれたようなので、痛み分けということで",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_050.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "ec4cc029926faf275020df27af22a36fd001e8305859c4d86b56befa326e4b61",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_050.wav",
      "subtitle": "……不过呢，铃木小姐您对几个孩子也没少下狠手，\n就当我们扯平了吧",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_064",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "蕾叶には、あんたのファミリーとばーちゃんたちがついてる。 そのことは忘れちゃいけないよ",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_064.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "9132c6b5ceb394b978475337a18e34690e6a2ddd632ec578845325b43451a5d9",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_064.wav",
      "subtitle": "蕾叶，你身边有你的Family，也有我们这些奶奶。\n这件事你可不能忘了哦",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_076",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "じゃ、あんたはファミリーのとこに帰りな。 お見送りはここまでで充分だから",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_076.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "2fc0886bbc32d060db59ae0f392ba24bfcb19a5aebed3514ce7e3bcaeb0e69a9",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_076.wav",
      "subtitle": "那，你回你的Family那边去吧。\n送到这里就可以了",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_026",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "いやあ、これだけいい笑顔が見られたから 次の旅も心置きなく行けそうだ",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_026.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "26ad79c6ae78900632742b454c625aeffbd7d88d019085a3359aa58a5e909cff",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_026.wav",
      "subtitle": "哎呀，看到你们笑得这么开心，\n下一趟旅行我也能放心出发了",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_041",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10099",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "積もる話は山ほどあるんだ。 みんな、ご飯にしよう！ 両ファミリー顔合わせだ！！",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_041.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "0d378c98d4554b846c0a2fbff4adc0bf56b39cb6f0da1c3716b27447797ae9d2",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_041.wav",
      "subtitle": "大家都攒了一肚子话要说。\n那就开饭吧！两边的Family见个面！！",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_033",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "――ということで、この話は終わりだ。 いくら連絡されたって譲らないからな",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_033.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "2a3231d8a50014e539fe7edfee5869098deaa2e7d07213670aa23ec9703d4e7c",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_033.wav",
      "subtitle": "——所以，这事儿就翻篇了。\n不管你怎么联系我，我都不会让步的",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_063",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『今まであんたのやりたいようにやらせてきたけど…… もう充分頑張ったよ』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_063.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "ee13d9bc6eef2aa9d5b4c64253f6f05b00ee1e71628e5c0917bfa9c78811955e",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_063.wav",
      "subtitle": "『今まであんたのやりたいようにやらせてきたけど…… もう充分頑張ったよ』",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_034",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "あれ、もっと羨ましがると思ったのに。 昔みたいに『私も行きたかった〜！』って",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_034.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "4903d5f170ff0e33213abeec0e6c59b497fc177c547b32349d3925ef1ebe34a5",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_034.wav",
      "subtitle": "咦，我还以为你会更羡慕的。\n会像以前那样喊着『我也好想去啊～！』",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_051",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『ライブハウスのことは今は気にしなくていい。 ばーちゃんに任せとけ』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_051.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "898d1b8d81f4ba6b0971c902809fac7c0eda463cf6c0699ba5f46e6c70fccb7c",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_051.wav",
      "subtitle": "『Live House的事现在不用担心。\n交给奶奶就好』",
      "personality": null
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_057",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『……そこまで言えるようになるなんて、 いいファミリーに出会ったな、蕾叶』",
